DLTr7laXSdb_xoA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af3LN2uPPlDCCQ8JoAQi9lBUnvtpSyJKtixZ2XJhjZS1lg&oe=69F20127"}, "display_name": "ACE", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ace delivers an unmatched shooting experience for players of all ability levels. Hone your practical shooting skills, compete with friends in multiplayer, or blast robots from all angles. With a wide variety of handguns, optics, and game modes, Ace provides a fun challenge for everyone. Use the app with the stunningly realistic Ace Handset for an unparalleled experience. \n\nSHARPEN YOUR SKILLS\nDozens of practical shooting stages, drills for fundamentals, and instant feedback to help you improve. \n\nEXPERIENCE NEW THRILLS\nEngage drones in a 360 degree field of fire. Run and gun on the move. Defend your position with friends. Ace has a library of games offering hours of fun.\n\nCOMPETE IN MULTIPLAYER\nEarn a spot on the Drill Leaderboard. Win in-game currency from pop-up matches. Compete live with friends in multiplayer. \n\nSHOOT WITH REALISM\nBuilt by shooters, made for everyone.  Ace incorporates authentic ballistics and physics bringing realistic shooting to a platform anyone can enjoy.\n\nUPGRADE WITH THE ACE HANDSET \nShoot today with the Quest Controller. For a truly immersive experience use the Ace Handset.  Compatible with the Quest Controller, the Ace Handset provides the size, weight, trigger pull, and magazine release feel of a real handgun. \nGet your Ace Handset today at www.AceXR.com", "short_description": "Ace VR Shooting \u2013 Train. Game. Win. Sharpen your shooting skills and enjoy new thrills. Ace delivers an authentic and immersive shooting experience from your living room. Hone your practical shooting ability, compete with friends in multiplayer, or blast robots from all angles. With a wide variety of handguns, optics, and game modes, Ace provides endless play to shooters of all skill levels. \nUse the app with the stunningly realistic Ace Handset for an unparalleled experience. "}]}, "developer_name": "Ace", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://platform.acexr.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://platform.acexr.com/terms", "publisher_name": "Ace", "support_website_url": "https://www.acexr.com/contact", "website_url": "https://acexr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "7092793510808218"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 3, "nodes": [{"status": "PENDING", "id": "1278948147565415"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "309954121930023"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "236637499399419"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "309954121930023"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 0, "status": "PENDING", "id": "1278948147565415"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "26966950456299229", "version": "0.14.1"}, "id": "1262405364432113", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7092793504141552", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26966950456299229"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1262405364432113"}]}, "change_log": "# Fresh update just dropped!\n\n### What's New - v0.14.1\n\n\n**Fixed**\n- No more random teleports or rotations when picking stages or advancing through a series without touching the thumbsticks\n- Better performance on longer sessions: fewer crashes, less stuttering, and fewer frame drops after switching guns several times\n- Shadow 2 front sight can now be removed, just like other optics-ready pistols\n- New Swinger 2.0 logic. Swinger targets have been rebuilt with more reliable activation behavior.\n- Target in \"Around the Bend\" repositioned so it no longer clips into scenery\n- Drop turner targets no longer re-trigger before resetting\n- Stage creator names now display correctly for community stages\n- Privacy Policy and Terms of Service links updated to the new portal.acexr.com pages\n\n See you on the range!\n\n", "created_date": 1777065318, "id": "26966950456299229", "version": "0.14.1", "version_code": 1477, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "26966940732966868"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7092793504141552", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26966950456299229"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1777056849, "id": "26965674313093510", "version": "0.14.0", "version_code": 1476, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "26965665993094342"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": 